{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/3673c5b33332a735c6d00ff43803e162.avif?t=1771251006\" width=622 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Guilty as Sock!, it\u2019s a free-for-all with your friends! The prosecutor throws wild accusations, and with your evidence cards, you\u2019ll either defend yourself or roast the accused. The judge? Just trying (and probably failing) to keep things under control as chaotic lawyers yell their way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/ff9b2cc5fc2f762dba2ea1f72b388af2.poster.avif?t=1771251006\" width=750 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/ff9b2cc5fc2f762dba2ea1f72b388af2.webm?t=1771251006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/ff9b2cc5fc2f762dba2ea1f72b388af2.mp4?t=1771251006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/cb88961619aa4436a4d47b4b13f470e3.avif?t=1771251006\" width=622 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lawyer or prosecutor? Grab your evidence cards and twist the story to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/1dc05ecf98bc7af508ee82dfe1a0191e.avif?t=1771251006\" width=620 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to throw your opponent off their game? Talk over them, toss paper balls, mock them\u2014whatever it takes to sway the verdict in your favor! Chaos is the law here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/724a5448aab762de55a58dcf137c1515.poster.avif?t=1771251006\" width=750 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/724a5448aab762de55a58dcf137c1515.webm?t=1771251006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/724a5448aab762de55a58dcf137c1515.mp4?t=1771251006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/374229b09d18cc9cbcf68a9ce714b13b.avif?t=1771251006\" width=622 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the judge, you control the courtroom\u2014give the floor, punish unruly lawyers, and toss out any evidence you find suspicious (or just ridiculous). Whether you deliver a fair verdict or go full rogue, it\u2019s all in your hands! Will justice prevail? Meh\u2026 probably not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/0aecbd642a808f50c3e9b1dd35a72dc2.poster.avif?t=1771251006\" width=750 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/0aecbd642a808f50c3e9b1dd35a72dc2.webm?t=1771251006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/0aecbd642a808f50c3e9b1dd35a72dc2.mp4?t=1771251006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/dfcdc20b02541b5a77d57a7801732815.avif?t=1771251006\" width=622 height=79 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WITNESS\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Supports prosecution or defense by providing key facts that can sway the trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BAILIFF\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Keeps order with tools to subdue unruly players. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOURNALIST\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Can publish up to 3 breaking news articles per trial, usable as evidence. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JUROR</strong> \u2013 Votes guilty or not guilty via buzzers and draws doodles on their slate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These roles add chaos, strategy, and humor to every courtroom session!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/6a6f5d07aa3ddf97baebe45bd758bb40.poster.avif?t=1771251006\" width=800 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/6a6f5d07aa3ddf97baebe45bd758bb40.webm?t=1771251006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/extras/6a6f5d07aa3ddf97baebe45bd758bb40.mp4?t=1771251006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please note that we are not responsible for user-generated content shared during games with strangers. Play with people you trust for the best experience.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crumbled Plea","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/17a62e38ceebc3e37d745fe3c5a24770d3962500.jpg"},{"name":"Objection: TL;DR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/a38e9f97050b09a08eda048acb21b7fbee79e388.jpg"},{"name":"Justice shoots from my fingertips!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/d56d87fef184d8a57d85f4ead6453f29117b7a3d.jpg"},{"name":"Silence is Golden, Farts are Platinum","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/3f2dc62b2dcdfd7d0a5caea1b47613886eab1621.jpg"},{"name":"Final Fist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/e64b85756c19b0cb21702cf09f5387179a86c8e1.jpg"},{"name":"The Accuser's Finger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/87a82519d0b5fd20a413a6b2b30e713db5fcc9a0.jpg"},{"name":"Shocked, Shocking, Over-Shocked","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/f18e60417f44ff8c506cc6546c4b93e7ef6df30a.jpg"},{"name":"The King of Blocking","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/a2a27ed75b5933d8f3e14ec350bec0b8ff0faa76.jpg"},{"name":"Loose Tongue, Lost Cases","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/5a1ecebbcb6acece5f6a4398c56a3659e81c645d.jpg"},{"name":"Your Honor, It\u2019s Me Again!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400930/8189a9d2bfb4d97126d9d3cf9f964abf26563079.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400930?t=1771251006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/67829e7c8f346868ff9870b1beaba2d8e014f10c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771251006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400930/aff7f016e